# ============================================================
#  The cast. Each NPC has a relationship record:
#    rel  (-100..100)  how they feel about you
#    love (0..100)     romantic interest (romance: true only)
#    bond             none | friend | close | rival | nemesis | partner | ex
#  Characters are introduced with `meet <id>` (or any rel/love/bond change).
# ============================================================

@npc lyra
name: Lyra Vaneshade
